b.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114069","id":3659780645,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7aI9Il","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-16T10:12:36Z","updated_at":"2025-12-16T10:12:36Z","body":"Reproducible on macOS 26.2 (25C56) with Metal renderer, but not with Vulkan.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3659780645/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3716062872","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114069#issuecomment-3716062872","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114069","id":3716062872,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7dfp6Y","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-06T19:44:32Z","updated_at":"2026-01-06T19:45:22Z","body":"I can confirm this on 4.6.beta2 (M4 Max, macOS 26.1). I bisected the regression to afd12e32ad66fabff5df35312311e38b0c396271. **However, this is not what causes the actual rendering issue (read on further below).** The issue only occurs on Metal, not MoltenVK or Compatibility.\n\nNote that on commits where the issue doesn't occur, the mesh/camera doesn't move at all, while it moves on commits where the issue occurs. This means the issue is not directly caused by rendering, but by animation playback causing the rendering issue to occur. If you were to replicate the exact same movement in a prior commit, the same rendering issue would happen.\n\nTo reproduce the issue reliably regardless of animation import shenanigans, I replicated the animation through scripting. In this case, I bisected the **actual** rendering regression to 230adb7511b5298d67970f14990ae53f8be96e17. cc @stuartcarnie \n\nThe regression happens slightly further than the upgrade to Metal 4 according to the startup log (4.6.dev1 ran on Metal 3.2, 4.6.dev2 and later run on Metal 4.0 when supported).\n\n**Modified testing project:** [test-1-script.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24458679/test-1-script.zip)","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"